  "layout_intro_body": {
    "en": "Place and tune every element of the HUD here. Shift + Backspace saves and exits.\n- Click an element to open its Options: enable, scale, Visible on, colours and its own settings.\n- Drag to move, drag a corner to scale, right-click to reset.\n- Shift + M switches between mod widgets and vanilla HUD elements; Other HUD elements lists the rest.\n- Arrow keys / d-pad nudge by 1 px (Shift: 10 px).\n- Gamepad: right stick moves the cursor, LT + right stick moves, RT + right stick scales, A clicks, B resets, Y opens Options.\n- {key} now only holds global settings."
  },
